  "description": "Experience Hungry Shark Evolution - available for free download and simple installation. Completely secure with no viruses or malware risks. Always access the latest update effortlessly.",
  "editor_review": "Immerse yourself in the exciting oceanic adventures of Hungry Shark Evolution, the official game for Shark Week! As a ravenous shark equipped with powerful jaws, you'll need to survive by devouring anything and anyone that crosses your path. Explore a vast underwater landscape and evolve your sharks to dominate as the top predator. With over a dozen distinct species of fish, sharks, and baby sharks to transform, alongside various land animals to feast on, this game offers endless fun. Enhance your gameplay with gear like lasers and jetpacks, trigger Gold Rush for higher scores, and take part in special events to earn exclusive prizes. Whether you're offline or online, this captivating shark simulator can be enjoyed without an internet connection. So, are you ready to tap into your primal instincts? Let the feast commence!",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Control a ravenous shark and thrive by consuming everything in your vicinity.",
    "Navigate a vast underwater realm and evolve into various kinds of sharks such as the Great White and\n              Megalodon.",
    "Collect and nurture baby sharks to amplify your predatory abilities.",
    "Outfit your shark with cool gear like lasers, jetpacks, and stylish hats.",
    "Join in-game events, trigger Gold Rush, and earn more points."
  ],
